1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,050
kalpana kijiye, ek aisa prani

2
00:00:02,050 --> 00:00:03,549
jisaki sans mein jahar hai,

3
00:00:03,549 --> 00:00:05,390
jisaka sparsh mrityu hai, jisaki

4
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:07,604
aankhon mein samucha brahmand samaya

5
00:00:07,604 --> 00:00:09,298
hai. aur phir kalpana kijiye

6
00:00:09,298 --> 00:00:10,496
ki us prani ko khud

7
00:00:10,496 --> 00:00:12,222
mahadev ne apne gale mein

8
00:00:12,222 --> 00:00:13,020
dharan kiya.

9
00:00:13,490 --> 00:00:15,711
kyun? kyunki woh koee sadharan

10
00:00:15,711 --> 00:00:17,193
sarp nahi tha. woh tha

11
00:00:17,193 --> 00:00:18,965
vasuki, nagon ka raja.

12
00:00:19,435 --> 00:00:20,567
woh sarp jisane ek bar

13
00:00:20,567 --> 00:00:21,967
apna pura sharir rassi ki

14
00:00:21,967 --> 00:00:23,465
tarah de diya, taki devata

15
00:00:23,465 --> 00:00:24,832
aur asur milakar srishti ko

16
00:00:24,832 --> 00:00:25,415
bacha sake.

17
00:00:25,885 --> 00:00:27,724
woh raja jisane asahaniy dard

18
00:00:27,724 --> 00:00:29,190
mein bhi munh nahi khola.

19
00:00:29,190 --> 00:00:30,664
woh bhakt jisake bare mein

20
00:00:30,664 --> 00:00:32,405
khud bhagavan krishn ne gita

21
00:00:32,405 --> 00:00:33,811
mein kaha, sarpon mein main

22
00:00:33,811 --> 00:00:34,525
vasuki hun.
